Professional Skill Tags
Reusable CSS classes can also create visual labels for professional competencies.
.skill-tag {
  display: inline-block;
  background-color: #eaf1f7;
  color: #142b42;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}

